  New intentions for growth and truth\nThis New Moon lands in your 9th hous
 e of expansion\, study\, travel and beliefs — with the Sun there too\, d
 oubling the focus on where you want to grow beyond your usual world. Venus
 \, ruler of this Libra Moon\, sits natally in your 4th house of home and f
 amily\, but right now transits this same 9th house — meaning your sense 
 of worth and love is intertwined with how you explore and learn. This is a
  moment to plant seeds around expanding your horizons in a way that still 
 feels emotionally grounded. Try intentions like: 'I commit to exploring on
 e new belief or place that challenges my comfort zone\,' 'I commit to valu
 ing my own growth as much as my roots\,' or 'I commit to having one honest
  conversation about what I truly believe.' You'll revisit this intention a
 t the Full Moon in Libra on 2027-03-22. → What truth are you ready to ex
 pand into?
